WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:11.298
Hi there!

2
00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:14.359
Hi there!

3
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.309
Who are you?

4
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.931
I'm a polar bear.

5
00:00:20.932 --> 00:00:25.594
I'm a mammal.

6
00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:28.314
Where do you live?

7
00:00:28.315 --> 00:00:32.193
We live around the Arctic Ocean.

8
00:00:32.194 --> 00:00:35.997
We like the ice along the coast.

9
00:00:35.998 --> 00:00:38.930
The Arctic is cold!

10
00:00:38.931 --> 00:00:42.276
Our thick fur keeps us warm.

11
00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:46.006
Even our paws have fur.

12
00:00:46.007 --> 00:00:50.752
We also have a layer of fat.

13
00:00:50.753 --> 00:00:53.310
Can you swim?

14
00:00:53.311 --> 00:00:56.905
Polar bears are great swimmers!

15
00:00:56.906 --> 00:01:00.869
We use our big paws for that.

16
00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:05.652
We can swim very far.

17
00:01:05.653 --> 00:01:08.922
Who do you live with?

18
00:01:08.923 --> 00:01:13.245
Most polar bears live alone.

19
00:01:13.246 --> 00:01:16.835
Sometimes we eat together.

20
00:01:16.836 --> 00:01:19.354
What do you eat?

21
00:01:19.355 --> 00:01:23.498
We eat lots of seals.

22
00:01:23.499 --> 00:01:26.628
They have lots of fat.

23
00:01:26.629 --> 00:01:31.302
We eat more fat than meat.

24
00:01:31.303 --> 00:01:34.661
How do you catch seals?

25
00:01:34.662 --> 00:01:38.526
We wait next to holes in the ice.

26
00:01:38.527 --> 00:01:42.847
Seals come up for air.

27
00:01:42.848 --> 00:01:47.704
Then we attack!

28
00:01:47.705 --> 00:01:50.579
I see a hole in the ice.

29
00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.497
Good-bye.

30
00:01:53.498 --> 00:02:02.366
Bye, Polar Bear!
